# tools/repack.pins — exact upstream files (channel aarch64) this image uses,
# one package per line: name<TAB>upstream_filename<TAB>sha256. The default run
# of tools/repack-omarchy downloads exactly these files and never follows the
# channel's omarchy.db for them; the signature and omarchy-trusted.fpr checks
# still apply, the sha256 column replaces the database's.
#
# Why pins: Omarchy 4.5.0 (stable channel since 2026-11-05) breaks
# omarchy-mobile's touch patches, which target Omarchy 4.0.6. Staying on 4.0.6
# is a deliberate choice; to move on, run tools/repack-omarchy --update-pins,
# review the new versions, and test (see docs/image/REPACK.md).
#
# name	upstream_filename	sha256
